<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Instructor Application Approved</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .credentials { background: #f0f9f4; border: 1px solid #17a34a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
      .credentials p { margin: 6px 0; }
      .label { font-weight: bold; color: #17a34a; }
      .warning { color: #b45309; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 16px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Congratulations, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Your instructor application has been approved. You can now log in to University Management System using the credentials below.</p>
      <div class="credentials">
        <p><span class="label">Email:</span> <%= email %></p>
        <p><span class="label">Temporary Password:</span> <%= temporaryPassword %></p>
      </div>
      <p class="warning">For security reasons, please change your password immediately after your first login.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; University Management System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>